   "en": "Government in exile is a feature introduced in ⟦0⟧ and expanded in ⟦1⟧, where a defeated country can survive hosted by another country, mainly of their own faction. This feature was included originally only to ⟦2⟧ countries annexed by Germany, but with ⟦3⟧, neutral ⟦4⟧ could be exiled in another country.",
